sequenceDiagram
    participant S3C as S3 Curated Zone
    participant AS as Airflow Sensor
    participant DAG as Airflow DAG
    participant CFG as YAML Config Files
    participant GLUE as AWS Glue Job
    participant SR as Schema Registry
    participant KAFKA as Kafka Topic

    S3C->>AS: New curated Parquet file
    AS->>DAG: File detected

    DAG->>CFG: Load publish configuration
    CFG-->>DAG: Dataset metadata, topic, schema ID

    DAG->>GLUE: Trigger Glue job (with config reference)

    GLUE->>CFG: Load Glue processing config
    CFG-->>GLUE: Source path, topic, key fields

    GLUE->>SR: Fetch latest schema version
    SR-->>GLUE: Schema + compatibility rules

    GLUE->>GLUE: Validate schema compatibility
    alt Incompatible schema
        GLUE-->>DAG: Fail job (schema incompatibility)
        DAG->>DAG: Alert / Block publish
    else Compatible schema
        GLUE->>GLUE: Generate message keys (idempotency)
        GLUE->>KAFKA: Publish records (exactly-once semantics)
    end
